    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_summary">No account, no backend, no tracking, no ads. Location is only used when you ask for it once, and during trip measurements; Zeitig stores durations, never tracks. Departures come from Wiener Linien; online journey planning (Transitous) and the map (basemap.at) are only contacted when you use them.</string>
